星，居命宫者，主领导才能，为人正直大方，有王者风范。","relevance":"适用于紫微等星曜"}],"suggestions":["本次分析采用【飞星派】进行解读","检测到7个格局，建议重点关注：禄马交驰格、紫微七杀格、巨日同宫格"]},"flyingStarAnalysis":{"palaceFlying":[{"sourcePalace":"夫妻","sourceStem":"甲","luFlying":{"star":"廉贞","targetPalace":"兄弟","isSelf":false},"quanFlying":{"star":"破军","targetPalace":"兄弟","isSelf":false},"keFlying":{"star":"武曲","targetPalace":"田宅","isSelf":false},"jiFlying":{"star":"太阳","targetPalace":"官禄","isSelf":false},"selfTransformations":{"lu":false,"quan":false,"ke":false,"ji":false},"collisions":[{"mutagen":"化禄","star":"廉贞","collidedPalace":"仆役"},{"mutagen":"化权","star":"破军","collidedPalace":"仆役"},{"mutagen":"化科","star":"武曲","collidedPalace":"子女"},{"mutagen":"化忌","star":"太阳","collidedPalace":"夫妻"}]},{"sourcePalace":"兄弟","sourceStem":"乙","luFlying":{"star":"天机","targetPalace":"迁移","isSelf":false},"quanFlying":{"star":"天梁","targetPalace":"迁移","isSelf":false},"keFlying":{"star":"紫微","targetPalace":"疾厄","isSelf":false},"jiFlying":{"star":"太阴","targetPalace":"福德","isSelf":false},"selfTransformations":{"lu":false,"quan":false,"ke":false,"ji":false},"collisions":[{"mutagen":"化禄","star":"天机","collidedPalace":"命宫"},{"mutagen":"化权","star":"天梁","collidedPalace":"命宫"},{"mutagen":"化科","star":"紫微","collidedPalace":"父母"},{"mutagen":"化忌","star":"太阴","collidedPalace":"财帛"}]},{"sourcePalace":"命宫","sourceStem":"丙","luFlying":{"star":"天同","targetPalace":"福德","isSelf":false},"quanFlying":{"star":"天机","targetPalace":"迁移","isSelf":false},"keFlying":{"star":"文昌","targetPalace":"田宅","isSelf":false},"jiFlying":{"star":"廉贞","targetPalace":"兄弟","isSelf":false},"selfTransformations":{"lu":false,"quan":false,"ke":false,"ji":false},"collisions":[{"mutagen":"化禄","star":"天同","collidedPalace":"财帛"},{"mutagen":"化权","star":"天机","collidedPalace":"命宫"},{"mutagen":"化科","star":"文昌","collidedPalace":"子女"},{"mutagen":"化忌","star":"廉贞","collidedPalace":"仆役"}]},{"sourcePalace":"父母","sourceStem":"丁","luFlying":{"star":"太阴","targetPalace":"福德","isSelf":false},"quanFlying":{"star":"天同","targ